-- Silverpine Forest and Hillsbrad Foothills: quest NPCs of the Cataclysm chains that had no spawn. Based on Legends of
-- Azeroth 5.4.8; the positions match the spawn maps on Wowhead MoP Classic.
--
-- Silverpine: Lady Sylvanas, High Warlord Cromush, Garrosh Hellscream, Apothecary Witherbloom, High Apothecary Shana
-- T'veen, Deathstalker Commander Belmont, Bat Handler Maggotbreath, Master Forteski and Daschla at Forsaken High
-- Command and the Sepulcher, and the kill targets of "The Warchief Cometh" (26965), "Lessons in Fear" (27548, 37 of 73
-- sniffed 7th Legion Scouts, Wowhead shows 37), "Sowing Discord" (27580, General Marstone) and "Of No Consequence"
-- (27547, 20 of 22 Cowering Troopers, rescued by clicking them).
-- Hillsbrad Foothills: Johnny Awesome, Master Apothecary Lydon and Kingslayer Orkus, who start and end quests.

DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9310300 AND 9310374;

DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9310400 AND 9310402;

UPDATE `creature_template` SET `minlevel`=20, `maxlevel`=20, `faction_A`=29, `faction_H`=29 WHERE `entry`=46125;

-- Cowering Troopers: clicking one credits the quest, he thanks the player and runs off.
